						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														Hi everyone. I'm working on completing the set of Dreadscale for Iksar Shadowknights. I have one bracer finished. I am still looking for pieces, and could use some help. Here is a list of what I am missing as of right now:<br />
<br />
For the boots, I need a Fire Emerald, Banded Boots, and Skeletal Feet (drops from Thick Boned Skeletons in Kurn's Tower). I have the Cactus Quills.<br />
<br />
For the second bracer, I need a banded bracer and Sapphire. I have the Bloodgill Scale.<br />
<br />
For the breastplate, I need a banded tunic. I have the Ruby, Sarnak Warbraid, ,and Scorpion Chitin.<br />
<br />
For the gauntlets, I need 2 star rubies and banded gauntlets. I have the Skeletal Hand.<br />
<br />
For the greaves, I need a star ruby, the skull of Grachnist (drops off named goblin Grachnist in Warslik Woods), and Zorach's boots (drops off named Sarnak Zorach in the Overthere.) I have the banded greaves.<br />
<br />
For the helm, I need a ruby. I have the banded helm, Sarnak Berzerker Head, and Sarnak Knight's Sword.<br />
<br />
For the mask,  I need a fire emerald and the drixie queen's wings (drops off of Lady Chromoir, a named drixie in FV .. this gives negative faction hits with FV outpost). I have the banded mask.<br />
<br />
Lastly, for the vambraces, I need 2 sapphires,  and a Golra skin (drops off of hulking Golras in Timorous Deep.) I have the banded sleeves.<br />
<br />
<br />
If anyone can help me, please message me in game or leave a note here. Thanks.						</td>
