					<hr width="75%" align="left">
					<div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2882">Serenna Nytefyrre</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2588">Laine L`ssinurn</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=3170">Teriel L`ssinurn</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=3103">Ellewinne</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=3214">Rathil</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=3213">Terial</a></div>					
