						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														The following is a list of information about how to acquire the drixie queen's wings.. this is the hardest part of the dreadscale quest.<br />
<br />
-------------------------------------------------------<br />
<br />
Alright, I did this quest solo as a level 40 SK.  Took about an hour, and that's only because I died on my first attempt. <br />
<br />
DO NOT search for Lady Chromoire right outside the outpost. There are way too many drixies, pilgrims, and guards - and they all have a huge agro radius. I found this out the hard way when I initially tried killing drixies to the left of the outpost, by the unused docks (not the main ones). <br />
<br />
My winning strategy - <br />
Try going down the shore to the right of the outpost, by the short curvy road (you'll see it on the eqatlas map, approx. loc is -2300, -1100). If coming from LOIO, its easiest route for evils is to hit the water and swim all the way around the outpost. It'll take a while, but its much safer than trying to cross the mainland. <br />
<br />
Anyway, once your in that area, you should find plenty of wandering drixies, and some pilgrims (be especially wary of the pilgrims, as they have a HUGE agro radius). After about ten minutes of carefully executed excurions inland, I found our dear Lady and immediately pulled her to the shore. Very green to me at 40, but still had fairly potent nukes for her level (right under 200). However, I would think this could be done around 30 (or earlier with help), especially if ya have a HT to burn on her. Hard as she is to find, I don't think she's as rare as most everyone has been lead to believe, as long as you search in the right area. Hope that helps! <br />
<br />
Sarec Swiftscale <br />
&lt;Knights of the Green Mist&gt; <br />
Vazaelle						</td>
