					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														You will probably need help if you are under level 40. (My estimate only, as a 39 SK friend nearly died umteen dozen times while waiting two hours there. He was feigning death every 5 minutes.) Anyone else will be greened and low-blued to death waiting for her to spawn. Everything in this zone aggros Iksars and some of everything I've encountered can see through invisibility. Some person of any good race needs to stand at the spawn site who has keen eyes, or preferably a Ranger (Yay! Go Rangers! Go ahead and crack about &quot;Ranger down&quot; standing in the middle of Drixie Central for 2 hours. I dare you.) using track. When the queen pops you've got less than 4 minutes to marshal your forces and pull her to the cliff, which is *not* safe, but is merely safer than the interior. <br />
<br />
Best of luck to you, <br />
<br />
Tsavor, 19 Ranger <br />
Brochis, 28 Shadowknight <br />
<br />
Torvonnilous server<br />
